{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>The El.</b> The meaning is that He is mighty and does no injustice; only His way is perfect. And He has already said, and His saying has no flaw in it, and a hint that it is refined, that He will forever be a shield for those who take refuge in Him. 'With you' or 'in Your name that I call.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The phrase 'וכבר אמר ואמרתו' (and He has already said, and His saying) is unusual; the second 'אמרתו' may refer back to a prior statement or may be elliptical. Translated hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:39.784504412Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}